-- ==========================================
-- 7. TRANSIENT / FRONTEND-MAPPED ENTITIES
-- ==========================================
-- NOTE ON DESIGN ARCHITECTURE:
-- In alignment with DelightOS's performant decoupled architecture:
-- Extras/Modifiers, Cutlery (Cubiertos) and payment methods are fully mapped and managed
-- within the frontend/code layers (defined in /src/data/mockData.ts).
-- This guarantees immediate, sub-millisecond offline calculations and transaction processing 
-- without database lookup delays.
--
-- For reference, these code-mapped schemas are:
--
-- A. EXTRAS / MODIFIERS:
--    * Soya Picante = $10.00
--    * Salsa Dulce Mango Habanero = $12.00
--    * Aderezo adicional = $15.00
--    * Philadelphia extra = $20.00
--    * Aguacate extra = $20.00
--    * Proteína extra = $35.00
--
-- B. CUTLERY (CUBIERTOS):
--    * Palillos = $2.00
--    * Tenedor = $0.00
--    * Ninguno = $0.00
--
-- C. PAYMENT METHODS (MÉTODOS DE PAGO):
--    * Efectivo (Cash)
--    * Tarjeta (Card / Terminal)
--    * Transferencia (Bank wire)
--    * Uber (External delivery integration)
--    * DiDi (External delivery integration)
-- ==========================================
